        "description": "Previous Information:\nCrisis Intervention: Immediate on-site or telephone assistance is available for individuals affected by family violence and suicide. This includes ensuring victim safety and coordinating crisis plans.\nTaykwa Tagamou First Nation - Health Centre - Crisis Intervention - northeasthealthline.ca \n\nCounselling & Mental Health: The Health Centre provides a mental health program that includes assessment, supportive and grief counselling, and referrals to appropriate resources.\nHealth – Taykwa Tagamou Nation\n\nRevised Information:\nDuplicate Record",
