        "item": "Physical Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information: a hospital has been established which provides support for the immediate community https://creehealth.org/chisasibi\n\nRevised infromation: Physical health supports in the community are reflected through Public Health, Public Safety, emergency medical and fire services, emergency preparedness, evacuation planning, and the Chisasibi Fitness Center. The Fitness Center says it develops “activities for all ages to promote daily physical activity,” offers weekly activities that promote “health, fitness and sport,” and serves “single mothers, children, youth, adults and elders.",
