        "communityKey": "creenationofchisasibi",
        "item": "Mental Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information: mental health support is open and available through Maanuuhiikuu https://creehealth.org/services/mental-health-services\n\nRevised information: The community’s Brighter Futures program is a community-based health promotion and ill-health prevention program and includes a Mental Health component. Program promotes the development of healthy communities through community-based mental health programs, services and/or activities, including awareness on depression, family violence, stress management, counselling services, and wellness activities.",
