        "item": "Spiritual Support",
        "description": "Previous information: commnuity involvnment is encouraged and supported in the community center https://creehealth.org/services/multi-service-day-centre-mdsc-services\n\nRevised information: The Chisasibi Heritage & Cultural Centre's mission is to protect, preserve, collect, research and exhibit our history, heritage, culture, language, oral traditional teaching, customs and values. It provides services of storytelling, traditional dwellings, Elders sharing stories, ancestral teachings, and traditional activities.",
        "date": "2026-04-27 00:00:00",
