        "communityKey": "creenationofchisasibi",
        "item": "Emotional Support",
        "description": "Previous information: new parents and families are supported within the community https://creehealth.org/services/awash-services-children-0-9\n\nRevised infromation: Chisasibi’s Public Health Officer shares self-care guidance for a happy mind and self-care, including sleep, light/sunlight, movement/exercise, nutrition, social connection, and stress control. It mentions social connection with family, friends, or community members can provide emotional support, reduce loneliness, lift mood, and support a sense of belonging and self-worth; stress control can help keep mood balanced and support mental health.",
        "date": "2026-04-27 00:00:00",
