        "communityKey": "creenationofchisasibi",
        "item": "Youth Support",
        "description": "Previous information: a youth council has been instated to support the youth and provide more perspective to the community https://chisasibi.ca/youth-council/\n\nRevised infromation: Youth are supported through Youth Council, Youth Development, Youth Center, and Brighter Futures. Youth Council serves youth aged 13 to 35 and aims to educate and engage youth in activities and programs, instill leadership skills, and provide opportunities to understand Cree language, culture, values, and youth roles in the community. Youth Development provides programs, workshops, and activities, mostly focused on youth, to learn new skills, develop social skills, build self-esteem/self-confidence, and stay mentally and physically active.",
