        "community": "Missanabie Cree First Nation",
        "communityKey": "missanabiecreefn",
        "item": "Youth support",
        "description": "Previous information: Connecting survivors and youth through the major community hubs is a start. Use of cultural crafts and ceremonies would be beneficial. Also use of arts based activities would be great as well. It is important to hear from the youth in the community to hear how they want to be connected to the survivors in the community. \n\n\nRevised information: Youth are supported through the community’s Education section and Family Services, including the Choose Life Coordinator role.",
