        "description": "Previous information: The Community Health Team offers public health programs and public health supports to Batchewana First Nation band members while incorporating a holistic health perspective with an Indigenous lens.\nPrograms & Services | Batchewana First Nation \nBatchewana First Nation - Health Centre \nBatchewana First Nation - Home and Community Care Program \n\nThe provision of practical support removes significant barriers to health, including non-emergency medical transportation and system navigation assistance.\nBatchewana First Nation - Health Centre - Non Dway Gamig - Home and Community Care - Medical Transportation - northeasthealthline.ca\n\nRevised information: Duplicate Record",
