    "contact": "Sherri Richard - \nReceptionist / Executive Assistant \nTel: 705-842-2323\nsherri.richard@thessalonfirstnation.ca\n\nAdministration Support Staff\n\nHealth Support Staff\n\nEducation Support Staff\n\nPublic Works Support Staff",
    "physical": "Community offers Community Health, Home & Community Care, Medical Transportation, diabetes/CHR programming, and access to visiting regulated health professionals. These services help fill gaps in chronic-disease prevention, in-home care, access to appointments, and local access to basic health services.",
