    "physical": "The community offers health services through the Brunswick House Health Centre. The Health Centre offers services in medical transportation, alcohol and substance abuse, counselling referrals, young mothers, diabetes clinics, and elder’s assistance. The NIHB Program supports overall health, disease prevention, and the detection and management of illnesses, injuries, and disabilities, and may cover medically necessary medical, dental, and pharmacy services.",
    "mental": "The community offers support related to alcohol and substance abuse and counselling referrals through the Health Centre. The community also offers Choose Life, which promotes the mental, emotional, and behavioral well-being of youth and provides immediate funding relief for youth at risk of suicide through child and youth mental health prevention programs and services.",
