    "youth": "The community offers youth support through summer employment assistance, youth recreational activities, and funding support. The community also offers Choose Life for youth mental health prevention, Jordan’s Principle supports for children, and education-related supports including the First Nation & Inuit Youth Employment Strategy, Post Secondary Student Support Program, and Indigenous Early Learning and Child Care.",
    "connect": "The community offers connection through annual and recurring gatherings, including an annual Pow Wow, a New Year’s Eve Powwow, weekly Elders programming at the Elder’s Complex, and Elders gatherings",
