    "physical": "The community offers Health Services including Non-Insured Health Benefits, Footcare, Weight Management, Diagnostic Lab Work, Community Health Representative services, Home and Community Care, Jordan’s Principle, Elders Program, Pharmacy Services, Over-the-Counter Medication, Early Childhood Development / Healthy Babies Healthy Children, Primary Health Care, and medical transportation.",
