        "description": "Previous information:  a hospital has been established which provides support for the immediate community https://creehealth.org/chisasibi\n\nRevised information: Health and Safety’s mission is to ensure the “health, safety, well-being and protection” of the community. Programs include Public Health, Ambulance Services, Fire Protection, Public Safety, Search and Rescue, Community Watch, and programs related to health, hygiene, sanitation, infectious disease response, healthy lifestyles, and emergency medical care. Community Services also promotes health and well-being through sports, leisure, physical activity, low-impact exercise, and fitness programs.",
