        "description": "Previous information: part of the grand council of crees, their culture is protected and taught throughout the community https://cngov.ca/community-culture/communities/mistissini/\n\nRevised information: Members in Cree Nation of Mistissini are supported spiritually through community-based cultural, language, and elder-led supports. Community describe Eelders as holders of traditional knowledge connected to the land, Cree language, values, and wisdom, and say elders teach and guide youth. The community also has Cultural Programs & Development, Cree Language, and an Elders Council within its Health and Social Development structure. These supports help fill gaps by strengthening cultural continuity, traditional knowledge sharing, language, identity, guidance, and connection to the land.",
