        "description": "Previous information: there is a youth health center, a sports complex, and child services https://mistissini.com/services-in-our-community/\n\nRevised information: Youth in Cree Nation of Mistissini are supported through the Mistissini Youth Council and Youth Department, which provide dozens of programs each year supporting youth health, wellness, and development. Supports include summer, part-time, and student work experience programs; the canoe brigade, journey of wellness, and other excursions and land access activities; fitness challenges, inter-band games, and events that promote active living, art, and culture; and youth centre opportunities to learn new skills, along with local Youth Achievement Awards.",
