        "communityKey": "sheguiandahfn",
        "item": "Physical Health Programming",
        "description": "Previous information: Diabetic Wellness Program, Geriatric Social Work Program, Medical Transportation Program, Community Health Nurse\n\nRevised information: The community offers a Health Centre that is both a medical clinic and an administration office for health and wellness. The Health Centre includes programs ranging from Community Wellness, Family Well-Being and Traditional Life-Styles, and Medical Transportation and health clinics are an important part of the Health Centre. It also offers Diabetes education/support programs.",
