        "description": "Previous information: Patient Transportation Program, Diabetes Stategy, Crisis Team Coordination, Home & Community Care Program (HCCP), Community Health Nursing Program\n\nRevised information: The community offers health services through the Brunswick House Health Centre. The Health Centre offers services in medical transportation, alcohol and substance abuse, counselling referrals, young mothers, diabetes clinics, and elder’s assistance. The NIHB Program supports overall health, disease prevention, and the detection and management of illnesses, injuries, and disabilities, and may cover medically necessary medical, dental, and pharmacy services.",
